WEBVTT

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.708
Jangan mundur, jangan menyerah!

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.416
{\an8}<i>"Cowabunga!" </i>Dor!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.666
MILIK PETER BURNS

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.875
"Kenapa kalian sangat jahat kepadaku?

00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:30.041
Seharusnya kita berteman!"

00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:36.250
"Kami bukan temanmu lagi.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.125
Kau cuma kura-kura pecundang bodoh."

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.666
"Seharusnya kau temanku, T-Rex."

00:01:44.625 --> 00:01:46.375
"Aku makan teman-temanku."

00:01:48.791 --> 00:01:52.125
"Dia menggigit lenganku!"

00:02:32.708 --> 00:02:35.125
Fergus, diam. Nanti Ibu dan Ayah bangun!

00:03:43.583 --> 00:03:44.916
Fergus!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.041
Fergus, tunggu!

00:03:56.541 --> 00:03:57.791
Fergus!

00:04:52.875 --> 00:04:54.125
Halo.

00:04:58.208 --> 00:04:59.041
Halo.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:13.583
Halo.

00:05:15.625 --> 00:05:16.833
Halo.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.958
Ini mainanku.

00:05:36.041 --> 00:05:38.041
Aku bermain dengan ini.

00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:40.833
Ini namanya kura-kura ninja.

00:05:41.625 --> 00:05:43.708
Dia suka bertarung.

00:05:46.541 --> 00:05:50.458
Tak apa. Kita bisa main yang lain
kalau kau mau.

00:05:50.541 --> 00:05:52.958
{\an8}Apa ada <i>Jenga</i> di tempat asalmu?

00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:55.125
{\an8}<i>Jenga?</i>

00:05:55.625 --> 00:05:58.291
Ini yoyoku. Kita bisa lakukan trik keren.

00:05:58.375 --> 00:06:00.750
Ini Tazos-ku.

00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:03.416
Aku mengoleksi semua…

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.291
Hei, ini penting!

00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:09.791
Ini kartu paling istimewa yang kupunya.

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:10.875
Apa?

00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:14.083
Kau tak apa-apa?

00:06:14.166 --> 00:06:15.625
Kau tak perlu pakai itu.

00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:17.458
Patah di tangga panjat pekan lalu,

00:06:17.541 --> 00:06:18.958
tapi bukan salahku,

00:06:19.041 --> 00:06:20.625
karena seorang anak mendorongku.

00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:23.333
Hei, itu tak lucu.

00:06:24.041 --> 00:06:25.375
Ini sangat sakit.

00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:31.333
Terima kasih.

00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:33.875
Aku bisa…

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.416
Kau yakin tak memakai sihirmu?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.000
Ya.

00:06:47.958 --> 00:06:49.166
Enak, 'kan?

00:06:51.791 --> 00:06:54.208
Karena kau berkunjung,
kutunjukkan beberapa hal.

00:06:54.291 --> 00:06:55.875
Ini namanya pantai

00:06:55.958 --> 00:06:57.833
dan ini Bumi.

00:06:57.916 --> 00:06:59.458
Ini juga bola yang empuk.

00:06:59.541 --> 00:07:00.625
Ini tempatku tinggal.

00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:02.416
Kau tinggal di mana?

00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:26.666
Teman-Teman, masuk.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:27.875
Apa rahasianya?

00:07:27.958 --> 00:07:29.416
Kau boleh diam di rumah?

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.791
Siap bertemu teman baruku?

00:07:30.875 --> 00:07:32.291
Kau tak punya teman, Petey.

00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:33.416
Sekarang punya.

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:34.458
Aku temannya.

00:07:34.541 --> 00:07:35.833
Bisa cepat?

00:07:35.916 --> 00:07:38.333
Janji jangan beri tahu Ibu dan Ayah.

00:07:38.416 --> 00:07:40.250
Ini pasti lucu.

00:07:41.916 --> 00:07:43.583
Tak apa! Dia temanku.

00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:46.000
Jangan takut. Dia tak berbahaya.

00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:47.750
- Dia tak akan melukaimu.
- Apa itu?

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:49.458
Dia tak akan berbuat apa-apa.

00:07:49.541 --> 00:07:51.083
Dia ini apa, Petey?

00:07:51.166 --> 00:07:52.291
Dia temanku.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.000
Ini kakakku, Jaden,

00:07:55.083 --> 00:07:56.500
dan temannya, Carly.

00:07:56.583 --> 00:07:57.583
Kunci mobil.

00:07:57.666 --> 00:08:00.125
Kau temukan di mana?
Dia benar dari pantai?

00:08:00.208 --> 00:08:01.958
{\an8}- Ya, benar.
- Dia bisa apa?

00:08:02.041 --> 00:08:03.500
{\an8}Dia bisa bicara.

00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:04.625
{\an8}Sini, lihat.

00:08:04.708 --> 00:08:05.958
{\an8}- Perlihatkan.
- Siap?

00:08:06.458 --> 00:08:09.333
{\an8}Bisa katakan "alien"?

00:08:09.416 --> 00:08:10.833
"Alien."

00:08:10.916 --> 00:08:12.500
Dia tak mungkin bisa.

00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:14.041
Dia bisa. Tunggu saja.

00:08:14.958 --> 00:08:16.666
Allen.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.541
- Dia bicara.
- Sudah kubilang!

00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:21.833
Dia benar-benar bicara! Apa ini?

00:08:21.916 --> 00:08:26.583
Allen…

00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:28.750
Kita akan memanggilnya itu. Allen.

00:08:28.833 --> 00:08:31.375
Bisa lebih keren?
Misalnya Ripster atau Slash?

00:08:31.458 --> 00:08:32.666
<i>Tidak, Allen keren.</i>

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:34.958
<i>Aku suka Allen. Nama kakekku Allen.</i>

00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:53.500
Bagaimana kalau ini? Apa ini?

00:08:53.583 --> 00:08:55.250
Bagaimana dia tahu itu apa?

00:08:55.333 --> 00:08:56.833
- Aku ajari.
- Ayo, Allen.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.416
S?

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.833
{\an8}Ini simbol Stüssy, Allen.

00:08:59.916 --> 00:09:01.791
- Bagus, Allen.
- Kau harus tahu.

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:03.500
Dia lakukan sendiri.

00:09:03.583 --> 00:09:05.083
Hebat!

00:09:07.958 --> 00:09:09.416
Apa ini, Allen?

00:09:10.458 --> 00:09:11.416
Cheezel.

00:09:14.166 --> 00:09:15.291
Allen.

00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:17.791
Allen, kau masih bangun?

00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:21.208
Allen!

00:09:23.041 --> 00:09:24.541
Kau bangun.

00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:36.000
- Hei, Allen.
- Peedee?

00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:37.875
Kita sahabat, 'kan?

00:09:37.958 --> 00:09:39.000
Peedee…

00:09:40.125 --> 00:09:42.000
- Spesial.
- Mustahil.

00:09:42.083 --> 00:09:44.041
Yang spesial tentangku cuma kau.

00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:47.708
Kau janji tak akan meninggalkanku?

00:09:49.291 --> 00:09:52.125
Kita akan bersama selamanya, 'kan?

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.625
Bersama…

00:09:55.333 --> 00:09:56.458
selamanya.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.791
Kau satu-satunya sahabatku.

00:10:06.333 --> 00:10:07.541
{\an8}<i>Berhenti!</i>

00:10:07.625 --> 00:10:10.458
{\an8}<i>Kalian bergantian melempar dadu</i>

00:10:10.541 --> 00:10:13.500
{\an8}<i>dan diberi hadiah atau hukuman…</i>

00:10:16.458 --> 00:10:18.083
Ya! Dapat Waktu.

00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:21.333
{\an8}"Di 0030, ambil kunci.

00:10:21.416 --> 00:10:24.333
{\an8}Kembali ke paling belakang
jika waktu habis." Keren.

00:10:25.666 --> 00:10:27.416
Kau bisa pegang ini?

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.083
- Ya.
- Terima kasih.

00:10:29.166 --> 00:10:31.625
Allen?

00:10:31.708 --> 00:10:34.166
Baik, Allen. Ini sumpah ludah.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:38.041
Begitu dilakukan, kita sahabat selamanya.

00:10:38.125 --> 00:10:40.250
- Paham?
- Paham.

00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:42.416
Kau harus ucapkan. Sahabat.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.833
Sahabat.

00:10:47.625 --> 00:10:48.666
Jorok, Petey!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.000
Kau harus ludahi tanganmu.

00:10:51.875 --> 00:10:53.125
Tak akan sakit.

00:10:54.041 --> 00:10:56.250
Ayolah. Ini tak resmi jika tak diludahi.

00:10:56.333 --> 00:10:59.291
Petey, jika dia tak mau,
dia tak perlu melakukannya.

00:11:00.416 --> 00:11:02.083
Dia ditolak oleh alien.

00:11:02.166 --> 00:11:04.375
- Hentikan.
- Maksudmu, mungkin dia tak mau.

00:11:04.458 --> 00:11:06.041
Katamu aku spesial.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.291
Bersama selamanya. Ingat?

00:11:10.583 --> 00:11:11.750
Kumohon?

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.458
Jorok, Petey.

00:11:19.625 --> 00:11:20.916
Jangan sentuh.

00:11:39.416 --> 00:11:40.541
Lihat.

00:11:43.166 --> 00:11:44.958
Lihat, Allen juga punya.

00:11:46.208 --> 00:11:47.416
Berikutnya boleh aku?

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.750
Maaf, Peedee.

00:11:53.166 --> 00:11:54.583
Apa yang terjadi?

00:11:54.666 --> 00:11:55.791
Itu menyedotnya!

00:12:00.291 --> 00:12:02.083
Allen!

00:12:10.958 --> 00:12:12.541
{\an8}ALLEN
KASET 9

00:12:12.625 --> 00:12:13.791
<i>Katamu aku spesial.</i>

00:12:15.375 --> 00:12:17.583
<i>Bersama selamanya. Ingat?</i>

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.166
<i>Kumohon?</i>

00:12:23.916 --> 00:12:25.166
<i>Jorok, Petey.</i>

00:12:26.083 --> 00:12:27.375
<i>Jangan sentuh.</i>

00:12:38.416 --> 00:12:39.791
<i>Berikutnya boleh aku?</i>

00:12:39.875 --> 00:12:41.541
<i>Lihat, Allen juga punya.</i>

00:12:44.416 --> 00:12:46.250
<i>Maaf, Peedee.</i>

00:12:51.708 --> 00:12:53.125
Petey, apa yang terjadi?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.166
Jangan tinggalkan aku, Allen!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.416
Jangan pergi!

00:13:05.458 --> 00:13:07.500
Allen!

00:13:15.041 --> 00:13:16.208
<i>Jangan pergi!</i>

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:18.291
Allen!

00:13:19.833 --> 00:13:21.333
Kumohon, Allen!

00:13:21.416 --> 00:13:23.041
Kumohon!

00:13:27.083 --> 00:13:28.833
<i>Allen!</i>

00:14:08.208 --> 00:14:09.541
Hei, Allen.

00:14:10.166 --> 00:14:11.666
Ini aku lagi.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.875
{\an8}Jika kau bisa mendengarku…

00:14:22.416 --> 00:14:23.750
{\an8}ini yang terakhir.

00:14:23.833 --> 00:14:24.791
FESTIVAL LAYANGAN

00:14:24.875 --> 00:14:26.708
Ini kesempatan terakhir kita.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.166
{\an8}Kukirim cara kembali kepadaku.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.208
Saat kau dengar sinyal kita…

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.125
ikuti saja.

00:15:04.166 --> 00:15:06.333
Jalurnya aman malam ini.

00:15:06.416 --> 00:15:08.250
{\an8}Tak ada sampah dan gangguan.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:12.208
Semuanya sejajar, seperti dulu.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.625
Seperti yang diingat semesta.
Seolah kita diberi kesempatan terakhir.

00:15:21.708 --> 00:15:24.666
{\an8}Allen, ini tak akan terjadi lagi

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.875
{\an8}sampai waktu yang lama.

00:15:27.958 --> 00:15:30.125
{\an8}Saat itu, mungkin aku sudah tiada…

00:15:31.916 --> 00:15:33.291
{\an8}jadi, jika kau di sana…

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:36.791
{\an8}kembalilah.

00:15:37.625 --> 00:15:40.708
{\an8}Karena kecuali kau bisa
membangkitkan orang mati,

00:15:40.791 --> 00:15:43.166
{\an8}catatan, aku tak keberatan jika kau bisa,

00:15:44.375 --> 00:15:46.000
{\an8}maka ini kesempatan terakhir kita.

00:15:49.666 --> 00:15:51.833
Omong-omong, ini Petey.

00:15:51.916 --> 00:15:52.916
Petey Burns.

00:15:55.041 --> 00:15:56.500
Aku masih di tempat yang sama.

00:15:59.416 --> 00:16:00.708
Aku akan menunggu.

00:16:05.333 --> 00:16:07.208
<i>Allen.</i>

00:16:07.291 --> 00:16:09.541
<i>Masuk, ganti.</i>

00:16:09.625 --> 00:16:11.541
<i>Ini Petey. Kau dengar?</i>

00:16:28.166 --> 00:16:29.625
Hei, Petey.

00:16:29.708 --> 00:16:30.666
Hei, Carly.

00:16:33.333 --> 00:16:35.166
Apa kabarmu hari ini?

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:36.416
Baik.

00:16:37.291 --> 00:16:38.125
Bagus.

00:16:39.708 --> 00:16:42.375
Kau sudah periksa rental yang kukirim?

00:16:42.458 --> 00:16:44.458
Belum sempat, tapi akan kuperiksa.

00:16:44.541 --> 00:16:47.041
Baik, kabari aku jika ada yang kau mau.

00:16:47.125 --> 00:16:48.500
Ya, baik. Terima kasih.

00:16:48.583 --> 00:16:50.125
Itu baju Jaden?

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.416
- Hei.
- Hei.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:54.833
Kenapa? Apa ulahnya?

00:16:54.916 --> 00:16:56.708
Dia harus pergi sebelum aku lahiran.

00:16:57.666 --> 00:17:00.000
Kau mau aku apa? Mengusirnya?

00:17:00.083 --> 00:17:02.708
Dia adikmu. Tak bisa kita usir.

00:17:10.083 --> 00:17:13.166
Bertahan saja untuk hari ini.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:16.916
Lalu kita bisa bicara kepadanya bersama
dengan tenang layaknya orang dewasa.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.083
Dia menyebutkan hari jadinya?

00:17:21.166 --> 00:17:22.916
- Tidak.
- Tidak?

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.291
Tahun lalu dia minta doa lilin bersama.

00:17:25.375 --> 00:17:26.916
Mungkin dia sudah lupa.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.875
Dia tak akan melupakan Allen.

00:18:08.958 --> 00:18:11.541
SELAMAT DATANG
DI FESTIVAL LAYANGAN COOLUM

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.041
Dor!

00:18:28.833 --> 00:18:30.000
- Maaf.
- Cam.

00:18:30.083 --> 00:18:31.666
- Ada jawaban?
- Belum.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:32.833
Kenapa lama sekali?

00:18:32.916 --> 00:18:34.083
Semesta itu luas.

00:18:34.166 --> 00:18:35.750
Mungkin dia meng-<i>ghosting</i>-mu.

00:18:35.833 --> 00:18:36.791
Dia tidak…

00:18:38.041 --> 00:18:39.416
Lihat ini?

00:18:40.041 --> 00:18:41.583
Saat ada sinyal, bergetar.

00:18:41.666 --> 00:18:43.666
Saat dia datang, bilang aku keren.

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.541
- Aku siap apa saja.
- Cam.

00:18:45.625 --> 00:18:47.833
Apa? Tak akan ada yang sadar.

00:18:47.916 --> 00:18:50.500
Aku bisa kemudikan pesawat alien,
jadi bahan percobaan,

00:18:50.583 --> 00:18:53.500
- bisa tinggal di planetnya…
- Kau tak akan pergi, Cameron.

00:18:53.583 --> 00:18:55.500
Aku sudah membuat jabat tangan.

00:18:55.583 --> 00:18:57.500
Biar kutunjukkan.

00:18:57.583 --> 00:19:00.041
Begini, naik…

00:19:01.958 --> 00:19:03.166
Petey!

00:19:03.791 --> 00:19:05.125
Bangun! Harus pergi.

00:19:08.541 --> 00:19:10.500
Aku mau mampir ke festival.

00:19:10.583 --> 00:19:11.541
Kau urus di sini.

00:19:12.166 --> 00:19:14.583
- Ya, tenang saja. Aku bisa.
- Baiklah.

00:19:14.666 --> 00:19:15.875
Tenang saja.

00:19:18.458 --> 00:19:20.083
- Ya, cuma Cheezel, makasih.
- Ya.

00:19:22.041 --> 00:19:24.458
Lalu… Cheezel.

00:19:26.875 --> 00:19:28.166
Benar. Makasih, Bung.

00:19:29.541 --> 00:19:30.375
Petey.

00:19:30.916 --> 00:19:32.541
Sarah, hei.

00:19:33.125 --> 00:19:34.333
- Cuma itu?
- Ya.

00:19:34.416 --> 00:19:35.250
Bagus.

00:19:39.125 --> 00:19:40.500
Rory melamarku.

00:19:44.125 --> 00:19:45.791
Apa jawabanmu?

00:19:45.875 --> 00:19:46.916
Kubilang "ya".

00:19:48.333 --> 00:19:50.208
Maaf. Ya, maaf.

00:19:50.291 --> 00:19:51.458
Lalu…

00:19:53.208 --> 00:19:54.208
- Makasih.
- Makasih.

00:19:56.583 --> 00:19:57.583
Kau percaya?

00:19:58.666 --> 00:19:59.541
Tidak.

00:20:00.458 --> 00:20:02.333
Mana bisa kau menolak?

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:05.708
Itu sangat bagus.

00:20:05.791 --> 00:20:07.083
- Ya?
- Ya.

00:20:08.416 --> 00:20:10.958
Aku turut senang, Sarah, itu…

00:20:12.458 --> 00:20:14.166
Rory sangat beruntung.

00:20:15.125 --> 00:20:16.166
Hei.

00:20:19.791 --> 00:20:21.541
- Itu punyaku?
- Ya.

00:20:23.708 --> 00:20:26.625
Datanglah merayakannya
bersama kami pekan ini.

00:20:26.708 --> 00:20:28.416
Trivia. Bermain. Berkumpul.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.125
- Pasti seru.
- Ya.

00:20:30.208 --> 00:20:31.125
Jangan begitu.

00:20:31.208 --> 00:20:33.125
- Apa?
- Selalu bilang mau, lalu hilang.

00:20:33.208 --> 00:20:34.500
- Tidak.
- Kau begitu!

00:20:34.583 --> 00:20:36.625
- Aku ada urusan.
- Apa?

00:20:36.708 --> 00:20:39.166
- Ada teman lama yang akan berkunjung.
- Petey?

00:20:39.958 --> 00:20:41.458
- Benarkah?
- Bukan begitu.

00:20:42.666 --> 00:20:43.666
Sebentar.

00:20:44.625 --> 00:20:45.666
Ajak temanmu.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.291
Ikut trivia? Kurasa dia tak akan cocok.

00:20:49.416 --> 00:20:52.708
Hei, apa yang terjadi
saat dia kembali ke kota?

00:20:52.791 --> 00:20:54.916
- Petey!
- Cameron!

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.041
Ini dia! Ini Allen!

00:20:58.625 --> 00:20:59.666
Allen.

00:21:01.541 --> 00:21:02.666
Petey?

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.583
- Kau urus di sini!
